    "text": "2 days ago The entertainment industry is mourning the death of actor James Ransone, who has died at the age of 46. Authorities confirmed his death occurred on December 19th, in Los Angeles, and officials have stated that no foul play is suspected. News of his passing spread quickly over the weekend, prompting an outpouring of reaction from fans and colleagues who remembered his distinctive presence and emotionally raw performances across television and film. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
